---A user profile's standing in Enterprise Frontier Safeguards, a program under which Anthropic approves the entity the profile represents and may approve any of the program's features.
---@class anthropic.user_profiles.UserProfileEfsProgram
---@field status anthropic.user_profiles.UserProfileProgramStatus Anthropic's decision on the entity the profile represents: `pending` while it is awaited, `active` once Anthropic has approved the entity for the program, or `rejected` once Anthropic has declined or has removed the entity from the program. `active` does not mean that any one feature is approved: read the feature you need in `features`.
