---@class anthropic.user_profiles.UserProfileExternalUserDetailsParams
---@field reference_id? string|distilled.Null The platform's own reference for the entity, for example the key of the end-user's row in the platform's database. Not interpreted by Anthropic and not enforced unique. 1 to 255 characters.
---@field onboarded_at? string When the entity opened its account with the platform, in RFC 3339 format: for an `application` profile, when the end-user signed up; for a `passthrough` profile, when the company became the platform's customer. Must be a complete timestamp no more than 1 minute in the future.
---@field account_status? anthropic.user_profiles.UserProfileExternalUserAccountStatus|string|distilled.Null The status of the entity's account on the platform: `active`, `suspended` or `blocked`.
---@field entity_type? anthropic.user_profiles.UserProfileExternalUserEntityType|string|distilled.Null What kind of entity the profile represents: `individual`, `business`, `non_profit` or `government`.
